<?php require_once __DIR__ . '/db.php'; security_headers(); ?><!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>VPR Privacy Policy</title><style>body{font-family:Arial;background:#f5f7f9;color:#17212b;margin:0}.w{max-width:850px;margin:35px auto;background:#fff;padding:32px;border-radius:12px}h1,h2{color:#062c52}p,li{line-height:1.65}.n{background:#f1f5f9;padding:14px;border-left:4px solid #062c52}a{color:#062c52}</style></head><body><main class="w"><h1>VPR Privacy Policy</h1><p>Vehicle Pledge Registry (VPR), a member of Diranor Group, processes information for vehicle-interest registration, searching, verification, security, audit and administration.</p><h2>Information processed</h2><p>This may include vehicle registration numbers, brand, model, chassis details where supplied, interested-party information, interest details, search history, certificate identifiers, dates and security/audit information.</p><h2>Purpose</h2><p>Information is used to operate VPR, produce search reports, preserve historical search evidence, investigate disputes, protect the platform and maintain administrative records.</p><h2>Accuracy and correction</h2><p>Affected persons may request review of information they believe is inaccurate. VPR may require reasonable evidence before changing a record.</p><h2>Security</h2><p>VPR uses access controls, protected administrative sessions, audit records, input validation and protected certificate links.</p><h2>Retention</h2><p>Records may be retained where reasonably necessary to preserve registry integrity and audit history, meet legal obligations, resolve disputes or establish what information was available at the time of a historical search.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>info@vpr.co.zw<br>secure@vpr.co.zw<br>+263 788 444 409<br>10 Shepperton Road, Graniteside, Harare</p><p><a href="index.php">Return to VPR</a></p></main></body></html>